edGuy.CoockiePuncher-20261002-155321.png", "id": "1744578966754173", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823790_1744578970087506_184867581268551437_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cairjmRdSm8Q7kNvwHvGY9K&_nc_oc=Adqz0MZeWvfHhq3ZlT1gTTyal-VybE7Q4EsfhUv3n_Rtm4f8T8wRCFpDHkC_TojWxC4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRRoflg2IXEohFAyzWK0_KCxGGH83iPRG-f_0MhCctnmQ&oe=6AF9D2E0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "CoverArt3Upscaled.png", "id": "1665458421844068", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823746_1665458428510734_7766498067514048318_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ZSbSlASGyNQQ7kNvwGZBDNV&_nc_oc=AdpNHK9a82XBR3Y-p_D8p_m6-m1xDAMjWgmjcvJZQ8a0pDwtU0MP-wYUXauxRZyrVps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQ3Mf1P_RdIYnLkllRQqr24WLgR83P188nRmeAcY-Cz4w&oe=6AF9E1BD"}, "display_name": "Cookie Puncher", "keywords": ["Cookie", "Punching", "Workout", "Bakery", "Boxing"], "long_description": "Welcome to Cookie Puncher - the only place where smashing cookies is not just allowed\u2026 it\u2019s encouraged.\n\nStep into a  world where your fists are the ultimate baking tool. Punch, crush, fling, and obliterate cookies in wildly satisfying ways. Whether you're going for precision hits or full - on cookie carnage, every swing counts.\n\nBut don't get too comfortable - the Cookie Thief is always looking for a chance to ruin your fun. Stay sharp, keep punching, and prove who's really in charge of the kitchen!\n\n\ud83e\udd4a Features:\n\ud83c\udf6aPunch Cookies - Smash your way through cookies with your own fists.\n\ud83d\udca5Crunchy Feedback - Feel every hit as you pound cookies into pieces.\n\ud83d\uded2Shop & Customize - Unlock new items and customize your experience.\n\ud83e\uddb9\u200d\u2642\ufe0fChallenge the Cookie Thief - Keep an eye out for the thief and take on the challenge.\n\nPunch first. Ask quest